-- Arguments: company (eight), legal act, material effect, I am a director, audit committee exists, the articles lay down another way.
-- A material act in a public company: the audit committee and the board.
`ic3 - תשובה 1` MEANS `אילו אישורים נדרשים לפעולה שלי` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE
